  "Use original database": "使用原数据库",
  "Your history is in the older storage format. Upgrade it to store history more efficiently and keep it searchable. ": "历史记录仍使用旧版存储格式。升级可提高存储效率，并保留搜索功能。",
  "Screenpipe will pause recording and history access while it converts and verifies your history, then restore your recording preference.": "Screenpipe 会暂时停止录制和历史记录访问，转换并校验数据后，再恢复原有录制设置。",
  "Keep the app open. Your computer will stay awake. Progress and elapsed time will be shown; the time needed depends on your database and computer.": "请保持应用开启。迁移期间电脑会保持唤醒，并显示进度和已用时间。耗时取决于数据库大小和电脑性能。",
  "Your existing database becomes the index for your upgraded history. Space is recovered as each batch is verified where the drive supports it; some network drives keep freed space for reuse. If migration is interrupted, Screenpipe must restore storage before recording can resume. You can retry migration afterward.": "现有数据库将作为升级后历史记录的索引。在磁盘支持的情况下，每批数据校验后会释放相应空间；部分网络磁盘会保留这些空间供后续使用。如果迁移中断，Screenpipe 需要先恢复存储才能继续录制，之后可再次尝试迁移。",
  "You can also start later in Settings → Storage.": "也可以稍后在“设置 → 存储”中开始迁移。",
  "Your existing database is now the index for your upgraded history.": "现有数据库已成为升级后历史记录的索引。",
  "Your completed progress is saved. Migration continues from that progress when you retry.": "已保存完成的进度。重试时将从该进度继续迁移。",
  "Record microphone and system audio. Turning this off keeps existing recordings and meeting history.": "录制麦克风和系统声音。关闭后仍会保留已有录音和会议历史。",
  "Cloud engines send audio to a server for fast, accurate transcription. Offline engines run on your device — fully private but use more CPU/RAM.": "云端引擎将音频发送到服务器进行转写；本地引擎在你的设备上运行，音频留在本机，但会占用更多 CPU 和内存。",
  "“During meetings only” records and transcribes audio just while a meeting is detected — saving battery, disk, and cloud transcription cost. “Always” captures continuously, 24/7. Requires meeting detection to be on.": "“仅会议期间”只在检测到会议时录音并转写，以节省电量、磁盘空间及云端转写费用；“始终采集”则持续录音。仅会议模式需要启用会议检测。",
  "Audio capture, transcription, and meeting notes": "音频采集、语音转写和会议笔记",
  "Audio capture recovered — recording is healthy again.": "音频采集已恢复，录制状态正常。",
  "audio captured — transcript will appear after background transcription catches up": "音频已采集，后台转写完成后会显示文字。",
  "detecting a meeting — audio capture starts only after one is confirmed": "正在检测会议，确认会议后才会开始音频采集。",
  "Continue audio capture when screen is locked": "锁屏时继续采集音频",
