  "Detects meeting apps (Zoom, Teams, Meet, Discord calls, etc.) to start and stop meetings and live notes automatically. Turn off if it starts meetings when it shouldn't, and start them yourself instead.": "检测 Zoom、Teams、Meet、Discord 通话等会议应用，自动开始或结束会议及实时笔记。若发生误判，可关闭此功能并手动控制会议。",
